  unitName: Mech Arms Grybe
  unitId: 40343
  unitNumber: 509
  description: A silent marksman selected to the 12 Guardians despite being from
    the otherworld. Though his appearance frightened many, Sodis admired his kindness
    and strength and invited him into the Guardians. Though many opposed his entry,
    Sodis went along and appointed him anyway. The priests also opposed allowing
    a foreigner into the land of the gods for a long time, though his personality
    and strength saw his opposers grow fewer in number.
  summonDesc: I've no intention of shooting you.<br>Please do not fear me.<br>Thank
    you.
  fusionDesc: ......<br>Hmph...<br>That's it...
